# No environment variables are required to run this project.
#
# `personal-ai` is a fully static site (HTML + Tailwind CDN + vanilla JS).
# It has no backend, database, or API keys, so there is nothing to configure.
#
# The `.env` file that appears in the Amp sandbox is generated automatically by
# the sandbox manager and is ignored by `.gitignore`. It is NOT part of this
# project and should never be committed.
